%PDF-1.4\n1 0 obj\n<< /Type /Catalog /Pages 2 0 R >>\nendobj\n2 0 obj\n<< /Type /Pages /Kids [3 0 R] /Count 1 >>\nendobj\n3 0 obj\n<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 4 0 R >> >> /Contents 5 0 R >>\nendobj\n4 0 obj\n<< /Type /Font /Subtype /Type1 /BaseFont /Helvetica >>\nendobj\n5 0 obj\n<< /Length 2162 >>\nstream\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 760 Td (JARVIS Architecture Overview) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 738 Td () Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 716 Td (1\) Core idea) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 694 Td (JARVIS is a local AI assistant built as a multi-package Python workspace.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 672 Td (It combines apps, runtime logic, model providers, plugins, memory, and skills.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 650 Td () Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 628 Td (2\) Main layers) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 606 Td (Apps: desktop, CLI, TUI) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 584 Td (Packages: plugin_sdk, agent_runtime, llm_client, gateway_protocol, config_core, ...) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 562 Td (Extensions: channels, providers, media, memory, tools, voice, productivity) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 540 Td (Skills: declarative markdown files under skills/) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 518 Td (Docs and tooling: docs/, tools/, security/, qa/, deploy/) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 496 Td () Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 474 Td (3\) Architecture rule) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 452 Td (Core stays plugin-agnostic. Extensions cross into core through jarvis_sdk.*.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 430 Td (This keeps the system modular and prevents hidden dependency coupling.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 408 Td () Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 386 Td (4\) Runtime workflow) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 364 Td (User request -> app/channel -> gateway/runtime -> model/provider -> tools/plugins) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 342 Td (-> memory/state -> response) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 320 Td () Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 298 Td (5\) State and config) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 276 Td (Canonical config and runtime state prefer SQLite-based storage.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 254 Td (Migration and repair logic lives in doctor flows rather than runtime shims.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 232 Td () Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 210 Td (6\) Why this matters) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 188 Td (The design supports plugins, sidecar capabilities, safe defaults, and long-term growth.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 166 Td (JARVIS aims to be a real personal assistant, not a single monolithic script.) Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 144 Td () Tj ET\nBT /F1 11 Tf 50 122 Td (Project source: AGENTS.md, VISION.md, README.md) Tj ET\nendstream\nendobj\nxref\n0 6\n0000000000 65535 f \n0000000010 00000 n \n0000000062 00000 n \n0000000122 00000 n \n0000000251 00000 n \n0000000324 00000 n \ntrailer\n<< /Size 6 /Root 1 0 R >>\nstartxref\n2544\n%%EOF\n